---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import {
	Code2,
	Braces,
	Database,
	Globe,
	Palette,
	Terminal,
} from "@lucide/astro";
---

<Layout>
    <section id="header" class="md:h-[50vh] flex flex-col justify-end pl-4 pr-4 md:pr-0 pt-4 mb-5 md:mb-10">
        <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-5">
			About Me
		</h1>
        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Software Developer & College Student. I work mostly with Javascript (NextJS, Astro) and Python (Flask, Django) based frameworks.</h2>
    </section>
    <section id="body" class="pl-4 pr-4 md:pr-0 mb-10">
        <p class="text-md mb-4">My name is Emmanuel Alabi, but you can call me Thursday.</p>

        <p class="text-md mb-4">Just your resident software dev. I'm a Thai-Nigerian and currently based in Rwanda while I persue my BSc in Computer Science. Very familiar with Javascript (NextJS, Astro) and Python (Flask, Django) for web development and the development of all other products which depend on a web server (e.g. Whatsapp bots, chrome extensions, mobile apps, etc).</p>

        <p class="text-md mb-4" >I've built projects like <a href="https://myde.emjjkk.tech" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MyDE</a> - a web IDE with LLM support; <a href="https://mydoc.emjjkk.tech" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MyDoc</a> - a simple markdown-based editor; and wrote python scripts for <a href="https://github.com/emjjkk/beat-detection" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">audio beat detection</a>. I also independently built <a href="https://ngozis-kitchen.co.uk" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ngozis Kitchen</a> in full, including its ordering system and admin dashboards, under the supervision of <a href="https://cometdigital.co.uk" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Comet Digital Ltd.</a>, a company whose official website was also built by me.</p>

        <p class="text-md mb-4">You can find out more about me on my website https://emjjkk.tech. That's also where you can find out how to contact me for collaboration or work enquiries.</p>

        <p class="text-md mb-4">I happen to also be quite an insufferable gamer and play VALORANT and The Finals even despite being on the back foot with very high ping.</p>
    </section>
   

    
    
</Layout>
